Comment: 0,0:22:09.98,0:22:10.02,ED-CN,,0,0,0,,EDJP-location
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.82,0:22:28.33,ED-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur4}曾认为如此单调的灰蓝
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.33,0:22:31.37,ED-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur4}便是这人生的色彩
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.37,0:22:35.96,ED-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur4}但未知的彩虹却满溢出来
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.09,0:22:41.46,ED-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur4}从我笨拙的言语漫延
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.46,0:22:44.47,ED-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur4}那份心意深藏心底
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.47,0:22:48.10,ED-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur4}「回看过去也没关系」
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.10,0:22:51.98,ED-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur4}教会我的也是你
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.98,0:22:55.23,ED-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur4\c&HFFFFFF&\1a&H00&}平淡无奇的日常里
